{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"690","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"D2. The Wall (medium)"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Heidi the Cow is aghast: cracks in the northern Wall? Zombies gathering outside, forming groups, preparing their assault? This must not happen! Quickly, she fetches her HC"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2"},{"kind":"text","text":" (Handbook of Crazy Constructions) and looks for the right chapter:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"How to build a wall:"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":true},"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Take a set of bricks."}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Select one of the possible wall designs. Computing the number of possible designs is left as an exercise to the reader."}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Place bricks on top of each other, according to the chosen design."}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"This seems easy enough. But Heidi is a Coding Cow, not a Constructing Cow. Her mind keeps coming back to point 2b. Despite the imminent danger of a zombie onslaught, she wonders just how many possible walls she could build with up to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" bricks."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"wall"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" is a set of wall segments as defined in the easy version. How many different walls can be constructed such that the wall consists of at least "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":" and at most "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" bricks? Two walls are different if there exist a column "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"c"},{"kind":"text","text":" and a row "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"r"},{"kind":"text","text":" such that one wall has a brick in this spot, and the other does not."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Along with "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":", you will be given "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":", the width of the wall (as defined in the easy version). Return the number of different walls modulo "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"106 + 3"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains two space-separated integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ n ≤ 500000"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ C ≤ 200000"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print the number of different walls that Heidi could build, modulo "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"106 + 3"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}